[2026-08-04T07:20:47.182Z]                 # The ini routines simply append a config item immediately
[2026-08-04T07:20:47.182Z]                 # after the section header. To keep the same order as defined
[2026-08-04T07:20:47.182Z]                 # in local.conf, invoke the ini routines in the reverse order
[2026-08-04T07:20:47.183Z]                 for (attr_no = cfg_sec_attr_count[sno] - 1; attr_no >=0; attr_no--) {
